B.aGT=s(["No. Read the correction and remember it.","Error. We shall redo it later.","Incorrect. Mind the details."],t.s)
B.aJx=s(["{n} in a row. That is serious work.","{n} right answers. Do not slacken."],t.s)
B.aqI=s(["Flawless. Top marks, and I rarely give them."],t.s)
B.avd=s(["Lesson finished. Decent work."],t.s)
